-- The class itself. INSERT ... WHERE NOT EXISTS rather than INSERT OR IGNORE,
-- so re-running the script is a no-op instead of a silent partial write.
INSERT INTO imported_classes (class_id, name, system, markdown, status, created_by)
SELECT 'hu-alien-edu-combat-specialist', 'Combat Specialist (Alien)', 'heroes-unlimited', '---
id: hu-alien-edu-combat-specialist
name: "Combat Specialist (Alien)"
system: heroes-unlimited
source_book: Revised Heroes Unlimited p.56
category: occ
occ_group: optional
skills:
  occ_skills:
    - { choose: 5, categories: ["Physical"], bonus: 15, note: "Printed 56: five physical skills." }
    - { choose: 1, from: ["Hand to Hand: Basic", "Hand to Hand: Expert", "Hand to Hand: Martial Arts"], note: "Printed 56: one hand to hand skill. A hand to hand skill has no percentage for the bonus to reach." }
    - { choose: 6, categories: ["Weapon Proficiencies"], note: "Printed 56: six W.P.s. A W.P. has no percentage either." }
    - { name: "First Aid", base: 65, per_level: 5, note: "Printed 56 grants it outright. 50% is this book''s own base, printed 33, +15%." }
  occ_related_skills: { count: 0 }
  occ_secondary_skills: { count: 6 }
---

## Lore

Rolled 61-80 on the Alien''s own education table, printed 56, STEP FIVE.

**The Alien does not roll on the Educational Level table.** Printed 27 sends every Power Category to that table except Special Training and Physical Training; the Alien goes there too, and then printed 56 prints a five-outcome table of its own that REPLACES it. So this is an occupation in the same slot as the eleven Educational Levels, and the Alien R.C.C. admits these five and nothing else.

Skill bonus: +15%, "when applicable".

Printed 56: "Skill bonus is +15% when applicable." The qualifier is the book''s own and it is doing real work here - most of what this package grants is hand to hand and weapon proficiencies, which have no percentage. The +15% is added to the five physical picks and to First Aid, and reaches nothing else.

Printed 56 closes the table with a rule that belongs to all five: *"All aliens can be taught THREE additional secondary Earth skills, but only if taught by a friendly human."* That is a thing that happens in play rather than at creation, so it is not in the secondary count above.

The Alien''s S.D.C. base of 20, its appearance, its homeworld environment and its powers all belong to the Alien R.C.C. on printed 55-59, not here. This class is the schooling and nothing else.
', 'published', 'data-script'
WHERE NOT EXISTS (SELECT 1 FROM imported_classes WHERE class_id = 'hu-alien-edu-combat-specialist');


-- Read the result back rather than trusting the exit code. d1-apply prints
-- these, and a CR in the stored markdown means the checkout mangled the file.
SELECT class_id, name, status, length(markdown) AS bytes, instr(markdown, char(13)) > 0 AS has_cr
  FROM imported_classes WHERE class_id = 'hu-alien-edu-combat-specialist';

